{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4gslO4XQ9ORuHzOQbUFy9A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:40.509729+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4gslO4XQ9ORuHzOQbUFy9A","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/HdhQkAwicWeiaMPs9uT2F70KXvkaz6hK1y9VswcYbbzWltaEsXDINDKDtl5wibAotsgGj9qIO0ojrlBrVxSxFKoEw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>中国科学院地球化学研究所简介</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhbjtF6ibYD2ao5scuLNXw0sNE1vJRSAmGCag7aZQXfp1Y1EylyvQF1PHODxqLBnNRMluwvzD4ocFd0kTBiaP4QZb0UfCY9hqeVLs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>中国科学院地球化学研究所（以下简称“地化所”）是国内外地学界著名研究所，位于贵州省贵阳市。地化所在我国建立和发展了以矿床地球化学、环境地球化学、第四纪地球化学、天体化学、实验地球化学、有机地球化学、同位素地球化学、元素地球化学、构造地球化学、流体包裹体地球化学为主的地球化学学科体系。目前拥有关键矿产成矿与预测全国重点实验室、喀斯特环境演变与生态安全实验室、地球内部物质高温高压实验室、月球与行星科学研究中心和生态环境与资源利用研究中心五个研究机构，具有一流的仪器设备和实验研究设施平台。</span></span></p><p><span><span>地化所是我国首批硕士、博士学位授权单位和首批博士后流动站建站单位，在所学习和工作的19位科学家先后当选院士；现有“地质学”、“环境科学与工程”2个博士后科研流动站；地质学（含矿物学岩石学矿床学、地球化学）、环境科学与工程（含环境科学、环境工程）、行星科学的硕士、博士点，以及资源与环境全日制专业学位硕士点。拥有4名中国科学院院士、160余名研究生指导教师组成的导师队伍。地化所是中国科学院大学研究生培养点之一。研究生的基础课程在中国科学院大学完成，科研及论文工作在研究所通过参加导师的科研项目完成。我所目前有完善的研究奖助制度，为研究生在学期间的生活与学习提供优质的经济保障。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>地化所夏令营旨在为热爱科学的优秀学子打通科研交流渠道，搭建沉浸式科研学习平台。让同学们近距离了解科研工作、感受科研氛围，进一步激发科研热情、明晰发展规划；同时引导潜力学子深耕科研领域、走入研究所深造，为国家科研事业培育优质后备人才。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhaJtSfX3kEwAAmfchXqLmegEp7udjiaMegCpEic0r6prTj4f7p5Z8ulHOlb1mgVYe6W2fhbRG3jAJibvamyqGFzic7MQZDF7Voggac/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><strong><span>欢迎2027届优秀毕业生积极报名参加！</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhbOTuCXg7BOKFIcPbHZyglcYx2icK6TD05n5IGia593ozib6BFP2FItPVVLDzrfx8TDzbcmeBxV1EL9vKicMngzmr7SUqJB8COImLs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><strong><span>老师</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>同学，速来报名！</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>老师，请问怎么报名呀？</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhYU0xEzuG64ZM3nMmakgscMiazhUiaRPhebWU0kw2jeABd0vXMCibZia1efgupVsnlzt9oyd4S2jftAADZ0Ga3YJdLI1PzwZByjNgY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><strong><span>同学</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhZl7ibAmkUmcAIsmcVNVd2H5CqMmMNnKOWlCxvWHZkdicXs2LI55pm7MNYuFibUtlwiaBIFYPWrFocIS6y7gnVADX6fibnPSIdI4ibIM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><strong><span>老师</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>具体内容请看下面。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/7QRTvkK2qC4ia5UrsIrkGrdzLz4x5Nbv7F8m1CQmrcTyM2C93TQoITGibV8TL7dJYbPS0I7SWC4mjCXAzUTJegqQ/640\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhb5pdZvsbt2EgcvFfwNwaFEGPVOSPyOic6mBfjGheyw2BrfysnLbI2nyerne7FwN7sHepvEyicTVyNDb4f5PXx2EmKiaa6X5Qghec/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>一、活动时间与规模</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>预计时间：2026年7月13-17日。</span></span></p><p><span><span>接收人数：120名。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhYkK0JFlldibib1ERI4K6bOmT63D5UnUib9u4legKib4D9mgWGKAb1EnUCDFHE1AOtY8MJZj6rjXHqRLhTEJicBjLxJia1OuEK7clmNA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>二、活动内容</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>研究所园区、科研工作环境、研究生生活环境参观介绍；科学家专题讲座、导师与学生面对面座谈交流、学生与研究所在读研究生交流，喀斯特野外</span><span>考察</span><span>或贵州省地质博物馆参观等。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhYuy9ZKClWV87vUtibZTdOdv2s1dicYKQAWnnGRq63BjdqTU3esyEeU3UyqsS2E7rzPDFsWLXO4FGQE0Ix6QuOibw7ia3Ep9ZrFc90/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>．面向专业为地质学、环境科学与工程、行星科学、地球物理学、化学、生态学等相关学科专业的三年级本科生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>．学习成绩优秀，具有浓厚科研兴趣；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3．英语达到国家四/六级水平（对有较强研究能力的英语成绩可适当放宽）。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhZZPfpVY3pRDLsulg7VYLHKC2mVIY1Xs8akXvkGSBEQSFwcPZWibK78xnYfjWH2XKFJVicVK5AicInMxqIa9j9azSzYOYAl6tnvoo/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>四、申请程序与时间</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. 网上报名：登录中国科学院大学科教结合协同育人行动计划网站</span></span><span><span>https://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/，</span></span><span><span>点击</span></span><span><span>“大学生夏令营报名”进入中国科学院大学夏令营在线申报系统并注册填报；选择承办单位：地球化学研究所，选择夏令营：中国科学院地球化学研究所2026年“优秀大学生夏令营”。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>申请者在报名系统中如实填写所有内容，并将材料按以下顺序扫描后发送至</span></span><span><span>jyc@mail</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>gyig.ac.cn</span></span><span><span>邮箱。邮件名为：姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>2026年夏令营，材料文件名为：姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>学校</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>2026年夏令营。</span></span></p><p><span><span>(1) </span></span><span><span>系统报名提交申请后下载打印</span></span><span><span>“大学生夏令营申请表”并签字；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2) 本科已修课程的成绩单以及排名(需要教务处或学院办公室盖章)；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(3) 英语水平证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(4) 身份证和学生证复印件（身份证正/反面、学生证里/外面）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(5) 其他证明材料 （如已发表的论文、奖励证书、推荐信等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>申请截止时间：</span></span><span><span>2026年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>24:00</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhYjUTqlXqm7ib6Vo61atj8Aia6POnGKibtrXf6LB2OibVrKxyZLrgliceYAgZUPT9GFdicEUr4LKOEJvHpoqffRksMVN70TxKonaDC2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>五、录取方法</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>录取名单经我所组织审定，并以电子邮件、电话等方式通知本人。未接到录取通知的同学为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhZWTkB9tcDlGedO9FHBRyh1qPq7mllic3v0IgzCjCFYu5lF9DHJA0SKTaTxI7aDSooQmmobc20knpXsd2husvHia9VvoE0vX0k2g/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>六、其他事项</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>夏令营期间免费提供学生食宿；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 旅费报销：学生从学校或家庭所在地至贵阳的火车票（硬座/二等座）或长途汽车票。购买学生票的学生，按学生票票面金额报销；如乘坐飞机或火车卧铺，按火车硬座车票价格报销。报销需提供车票或机票行程单（登机牌不能办理报销）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 参加夏令营的学生应严格遵守夏令营活动安排和纪律要求。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 夏令营活动期间的学生安全由本人和所在学校负责。我所统一为营员购买人身意外伤害保险，并在报到时签署安全责任协议书。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/va6oLibMSFhYVRd6eddmgpNcrQLyDticSMuzVY6bW8dINcb00VYibCfhTzsOfllj4ZYmko9NzWns8s4ryPJhxAvwu0iaE8kVZJAe8jibjQAHgqS8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>地址：贵州省贵阳市观山湖区林城西路99号 中国科学院地球化学研究所教育处</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮政编码：550081</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：0851-85891911、85891117</span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail: jyc@mail.gyig.ac.cn</